From 61a53c656d884f2e91ac21e7cf4f88e1ec37f00a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: coldshalamov <93robingattis@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:02:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] perf(world): keep Ceres optic lattices field-resident until
 approach
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Quiet Ceres was carrying ~42 Prism Gallery asteroids on entityList (~4 km
from the refinery pocket). Stamp them into asteroidField on FULL, promote
inside the authored decode disc, and shelve past exit — same membership
shape as far actors. Census: entityList 96→54, live rocks 53→11.
